<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Seika up on speculative buying.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Seika up on speculative buying.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sumitomo Seika Chemicals Co Ltd were higher in early morning trade on Tuesday, boosted by speculative buying, brokers said.</p>
<p>The shares, which were ranked first in the list of most heavily traded issues as of 0044 GMT, were 41 yen higher at 899 yen. The trade volume was 3.50 million shares.</p>
<p>The shares exceeded their previous high for the year of 858 yen, set on September 20.</p>
